    "profile.terms.title": "Terms of use",
    "profile.terms.updated": "Last updated: 25/07/2026",
    "profile.terms.p1": "By using the DanaBus app, you agree to the terms and conditions below. Please read them carefully before continuing.",
    "profile.terms.p2": "Tickets are valid only on the selected date or period. Please arrive at the pickup stop at least 5?10 minutes before departure.",
    "profile.terms.p3": "Purchased tickets cannot be exchanged, returned, or refunded after successful payment, except when DanaBus cancels the trip or as otherwise required by law.",
    "profile.terms.p4": "You are responsible for keeping your account and ticket QR codes secure. DanaBus may refuse service if fraud or misuse is detected.",
    "profile.terms.p5": "DanaBus may update these terms over time. The latest version will appear in the app. Continued use means you accept the changes.",
    "profile.privacy.title": "Privacy policy",
    "profile.privacy.updated": "Last updated: 25/07/2026",
    "profile.privacy.p1": "DanaBus is committed to protecting your personal information. This policy explains what data we collect and how we use it.",
    "profile.privacy.p2": "We may collect your name, phone number, email, ticket details, and location data (when you allow it) to provide route lookup, ticketing, and customer support.",
    "profile.privacy.p3": "Data is used to operate the app, process payments, improve the experience, and send notifications related to your trips or account.",
    "profile.privacy.p4": "We do not sell personal information to third parties. Data is shared only when needed to provide the service (for example payment partners) or as required by law.",
    "profile.privacy.p5": "You may request to view, update, or delete your personal information via Edit profile or Help center in the app.",
